uilding customer relationships, as well as home loans assistance, asset management, and fund-raising consultancy services. The company was formerly known as IM+ Capitals Limited and changed its name to Fedders Holding Limited in June 2024. Fedders Holding Limited was incorporated in 1991 and is based in Ghaziabad, India.","employees":2,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795612955},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795612955,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Fedders\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Fedders Holding (BSE:511628) - Stock Analysis","s":"Simply Wall St","d":1795161600,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxPb285ZzNCOFp0R0F6WFRlNzVIaWVMbFo5U283c1VEWU1HRG54Yjl5Q01mQk43WnoyUTFyTEdjaHpqbDV5ZmpuRlYyeG5fOUVGemZwR2N5RFo5OV9SYkpoNGtSWmRyZnVvaW0tZ3ZGb2FCS2RsVTJCcmc2ekFETC04aUV5LUJCaHhkUjEza0dpYjBzdw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Fedders Holding Share Price Today: Up 9.55% to Rs 58.38","s":"Univest","d":1795161600,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxNd25kdlpxbHg4cW5kMGVsNEtOcXNlOVpOdF9fbllNalltVkgyOFV3eEhtaGVDWmQ1OS1wdkgwWHNBajczWnQzbVpBMFp4MVhEai0tX09BRUQ4NjVWaTVsTXRvZHlYbVZub3Z6S1pId0VlWURtY2prdjVFNmxjWkNBdW5n?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Fedders Holding Q2 Results FY27: PAT Rs 15.98 Cr","s":"Univest","d":1794745740,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE1SaUVsRmJFVjFXeExrMGliZWNjUkZmd3Fla1Q1SkhIbEFycTRFa3lEWDFCNVJsRTRUMEtkMzNtSHJnZDZtX0RPenJaMWJVSkhSNkZmQTNXbTR5bWh2VTVwMEpqMmVPR08tY1owa2NqYXRDeXNDNzJPaA?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Fedders Holding Q2 FY27: Strong Profit Growth Masks Operational Concerns","s":"MarketsMojo","d":1794745553,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQVHlTWHJnME03MUZHSjB6Vmh0dDROMENITGhTMlRsUHhSWEJENTV2bDhPREpjalNXMEktakNLYjhCZVhsTXgxQk80VHdBSXdyT0tMYzkydHFISXcwOHM5WlBpYVdSaDFlNDBzRGx4ZHF3MDJvempaaHNhMUp3NENJM1p5bjJaS3hzWTRnenNnc2dZR3RLYjA3ajl6N0l1dk92d1VRaXRXMmJVdFRyM2FuRmdFTmJucUZKdExfUjQtSjd2cVhWUEww?oc=5"